OL,3,ADame Judi Dench: 'I can't do a play, a
OL,4,Afilm or read any more'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOscar-winning actress Dame Judi Dench
OL,7,Fsays her eye condition has left her
OL,8,Funable to perform on stage or read,
OL,9,Fmore than a decade after she was
OL,10,Fdiagnosed.
OL,12,FDame Judi was diagnosed with
OL,13,Fage-related macular degeneration (AMD)
OL,14,Fin 2012, a condition that affects her
OL,15,Fvision and has made it incredibly
OL,16,Fdifficult to even recognise faces.
OL,18,FSpeaking to Emma Barnett on BBC Radio
OL,19,F4's Today programme, she said: "I can't
OL,20,Fbe on stage. I can't do a play any
OL,21,Fmore. I can't do a film any more. I
OL,22,Fcan't read any more."
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/20
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
